                <mxCell id="iMzXw7-LtFSP-O9LAeiz-86" value="From then on, we will make requests each day for two days (overlap is better than gaps). We could also do what we are doing with the current stock data and just fetch it if it hasn&#39;t been updated in the last 15 minutes" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-640" y="15" width="190" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="iMzXw7-LtFSP-O9LAeiz-87" value="For DB, we can do multiple threads to store the data. This might add on to the time a little bit, but it would give us a total of around 30 minutes. We put a lock around the stock tickers, and check tickers off the list once you&#39;ve fetched and stored them in the database" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
